    "text": "<p><img src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/pyq/jee_main/659fdae9-0d4c-4a9d-ad4b-d0681dca232d-image.png\" style=\"width: 247px; height: 235px;\" /></p><p>At maximum angle <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math> ray at point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math> goes in gazing emergence, at all less values of <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>&#952;</mi></math>, TIR occurs. At point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>B</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mn>90</mn><mo>&#176;</mo></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup><mo>=</mo><msup><mi>sin</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>1</mn></mrow></msup><mfenced><mfrac><mn>3</mn><mn>4</mn></mfrac></mfenced></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup><mo>=</mo><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p>At point <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>A</mi></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>1</mn><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>&#39;</mo></msup></math></p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>sin</mi><mi>&#952;</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mn>4</mn><mn>3</mn></mfrac><mo>&#215;</mo><mi>sin</mi><mfenced><mrow><mfrac><mi>&#960;</mi><mn>2</mn></mfrac><mo>-</mo><msup><mi>&#952;</mi><mrow><mo>&#39;</mo><mo>&#39;</mo></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced></math></p><p><math xml